dynamic_trait_rule.nra:16:25: Dynamic<Ordered> needs Self only as the first parameter of every function of Ordered, and Ordered.compare names it elsewhere
dynamic_trait_rule.nra:20:24: Dynamic<Shape> needs Self as the first parameter of every function of Shape, and Shape.fromValue does not take it first
dynamic_trait_rule.nra:24:22: Dynamic<Maker> needs Self only as the first parameter of every function of Maker, and Maker.make names it elsewhere
dynamic_trait_rule.nra:28:23: Dynamic<Later> needs Self as the first parameter of every function of Later, and Later.size does not take it first
dynamic_trait_rule.nra:32:24: Dynamic<Nested> needs Self only as the first parameter of every function of Nested, and Nested.all names it elsewhere
